# ── Personal data — never published ─────────────────────────────
# Work logs, tasks and everything they reference. The app recreates
# the folders it needs on first run, so a fresh clone works without
# any of this.

# Uploaded and referenced media (work-log images, PDFs)
assets/

# The library: files you uploaded and images inserted into notes
docs/

# Uploaded quick-link favicons
icons/

# Local development record
dev-record.md

# ── App data stores ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# daily-studio-data.json holds ds_calendar (tasks), ds_quicklinks and
# ds_worklog (the journal itself).
daily-studio-data.json
daily-studio-longterm.json
daily-studio-docs.json

# ── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
